00:25:38.940 --> 00:25:41.310
What we're going to
show you is essentially

00:25:41.310 --> 00:25:44.460
a demo of an HPC workload.

00:25:44.460 --> 00:25:46.890
We'll do this in three arenas.

00:25:46.890 --> 00:25:50.280
On the top right, you see
the performance coming

00:25:50.280 --> 00:25:52.470
from the Elastifile system.

00:25:52.470 --> 00:25:54.570
On the bottom right,
